Source: cinectl
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Edwin Amsler <EdwinGuy@GMail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), libudev1
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/RandomInsano/CinemaControl

Package: cinectl
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: @DESCRIPTION@
 cinectl talks to a CinemaControl board over USB HID via hidapi: list
 connected boards, get or set backlight brightness, read PSU telemetry,
 or watch for live updates.
